{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Tile-placer\u00a0Roguelike. Build your board, empower yourself and slay monsters.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve your paths through the mysterious Shrouded Abyss and use Runic Tiles to destroy the strange creatures from the lands beyond the mountain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/9234968f3989f6c6d767fed44c029f00.poster.avif?t=1760637865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/9234968f3989f6c6d767fed44c029f00.webm?t=1760637865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/9234968f3989f6c6d767fed44c029f00.mp4?t=1760637865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Place tiles of various shapes on the board to create a path across, and attack your enemies through the routes you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover a variety of skill, artifacts and equipment to shape your character and descend into the deepest layers of the Abyss, where your survival depends solely on your strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Each run brings new skills to discover, new foes to face and new strategies to develop. Will you survive or succumb to the Shrouded Abyss? <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through three somber areas and face each of their gatekeepers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 70+ forgotten artifacts and pieces of equipment to mold your character and playstyle to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn over 60 arcane skills and cast them to hinder your enemies or manipulate the board as you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters and starting skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006200?t=1760637865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/4412a4aedfc89de08bffdf1d26f070b4daad99ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760637865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/d46888f8b3f33a1798632fc9a783bc7b6af8e36d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760637865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/d46888f8b3f33a1798632fc9a783bc7b6af8e36d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760637865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Tile-placer\u00a0Roguelike. Build your board, empower yourself and slay monsters.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve your paths through the mysterious Shrouded Abyss and use Runic Tiles to destroy the strange creatures from the lands beyond the mountain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/9234968f3989f6c6d767fed44c029f00.poster.avif?t=1760637865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/9234968f3989f6c6d767fed44c029f00.webm?t=1760637865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/9234968f3989f6c6d767fed44c029f00.mp4?t=1760637865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Place tiles of various shapes on the board to create a path across, and attack your enemies through the routes you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover a variety of skill, artifacts and equipment to shape your character and descend into the deepest layers of the Abyss, where your survival depends solely on your strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Each run brings new skills to discover, new foes to face and new strategies to develop. Will you survive or succumb to the Shrouded Abyss? <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through three somber areas and face each of their gatekeepers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 70+ forgotten artifacts and pieces of equipment to mold your character and playstyle to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn over 60 arcane skills and cast them to hinder your enemies or manipulate the board as you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters and starting skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mattalarc & Wolter"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/444d215fcf4c76da709405670e75064ba53b97fe/header.jpg?t=1760637865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Tileweaver","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Vista, 7, 8, 10 or 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Mattalarc & Wolter"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_a